{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And they shall take of the blood.</b> Ramban, of blessed memory, explained the reason for this commandment: because the constellation of Aries (the lamb) is in its great power in the month of Nisan, for it is the constellation of vegetation; therefore He commanded to slaughter a lamb and eat it, to make known that it was not by the power of the constellation that we departed from there, but rather by the decree of the Most High." "<b>And according to</b> the opinion of our Rabbis, of blessed memory, that the Egyptians worshipped it, all the more so did He make known through this commandment that He humiliated their god and its power at the time it was in its supreme ascent."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:57:58.498800290Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}